{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_synopsis", "source_sha256": "06fabf59ac6fd4759a162ae633e4d6d93a83523d35ee0811f3527db68b7ce161", "ja": "新曲公演に祖母を招待する事になった環は、\n楽しく準備を進めていく。そんな中、祖母が\n怪我をしたと連絡が入る。動揺する環に\nプロデューサーは公演の延期を提案するが、\n環は祖母との約束を守るとステージに立つ。", "zh": "环决定邀请祖母来看新曲公演，\n开开心心地进行着准备。就在这时，却传来了\n祖母受伤的消息。面对心慌意乱的环，\n制作人提议延期公演，\n但环为了遵守和祖母的约定，依然站上了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "f1670a0a8f9d1c1d03eea2631097fd0a788f0bcf125a3d87e1306fe717a86488", "ja": "ワアアアァァァーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "ff43d9760073a993f3c0df2423cdb437b6c37a24439d1fd47ad375e012423d95", "ja": "みんなーっ！　たまきの新曲、\nどうだった？　楽しくて、元気になるでしょ！？", "zh": "大家——！环的新歌，\n怎么样？既开心，又让人充满活力对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "5e2c9eab31c1cb79accbe3e6da5f40bb5adb8a9625e0df530bd9103985a92d11", "ja": "ワアアアアアアァァァァーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "636701186f5ed6f2da4ac9f03cc950ae80322deb629085c8e2dded79233875ae", "ja": "だよねーっ！　たまきもこの曲を歌うと、\nすっごく元気になるんだぞ～。", "zh": "对吧——！环也一样，每次唱这首歌，都会变得特别有精神哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "3e7209ed4a92b4f7478326acc437cb17e05814e0b5841528dbe19b2606a0076b", "ja": "友達とか仲間って、すごいよね！\nあっ、ファンのみんなもだぞ～！！", "zh": "朋友和伙伴，真的很厉害呢！\n啊，粉丝们也是哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "82545e4d2b6062ec3119de9c933a53d6430faff3309e98478b75e234fe58ebb9", "ja": "たまき、みんなのことだいだいだーい好き！\n今日は来てくれて、ほんとにありがとー！", "zh": "环最最最喜欢大家了！\n今天能来，真的非常感谢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "95511f20da30730e7d45afa2320fac78d981f7e6a39ea357b26a3fe71fc4db57", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！\n環ちゃん、最後までがんばったね。", "zh": "辛苦了！\n小环，你一直努力到最后呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "d89e0f77ec467e03effce3485ca36c272d1c5be7cd6c00c3e76546a712ef6ba4", "ja": "うん。隊長として最後まで引っ張ってくれて、\nありがとう！　すっごくカッコよかったよ。", "zh": "嗯。谢谢你作为队长一直带领大家坚持到最后！真的帅极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "7adf435d0777ddd28204640b3b639c952e3cc00d48ba9db69010e59c11716fcb", "ja": "環ちゃん……どうかした……？", "zh": "环……怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8911951904fd7503731e2467d2c7e93d00c9614ad3625dce3a56b779415c711", "ja": "あっ！？　えっと、なんでもないぞ～。\nばあちゃんの声がした気がしたから……。", "zh": "啊！？那个，没什么啦～。\n只是感觉好像听到了奶奶的声音……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "15b55a5c3c1ab533b11f0f92d2a7bde4ffbf2773f9965b173c03bc2daab2cabc", "ja": "たまき、ちょっとボーッとしてるのかも……\nえへへ。", "zh": "环境，可能有点发呆了……\n嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "d303cb2e28f29bab6778df3b3e14d549a9e30c9438df9cb433a7defd0e0a0fa2", "ja": "環ちゃん……。", "zh": "小环……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "cf9163f2f85599943246cc246151b3dfe86d392c4d407d7398a99b31c326ae00", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nみんなも、お邪魔しますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n大家也是，打扰一下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1ef776a7e56645e79b083d2e99f64a905c9545e206c0ab8457049a4274ad851", "ja": "環ちゃんと{$P$}さんに、\nお客さんがいらしてるんです。急いで来てください！", "zh": "環和{$P$}先生那里有客人来访。请赶快过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1015_p", "source_sha256": "31bf75133d3fcaacf29b9c11ffe95ca490ca402ed959f35a013e5025dc8579c0", "ja": "青羽さん？　お客さんって……。", "zh": "青羽小姐？你说的客人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "5e9f2e3ec0b53c06e31e021ba3bfd474724b18ed3772cbe61a419bb6615dfef5", "ja": "え…………ええーっ！！？\nばあちゃんが、どうしてここにいるの！？", "zh": "诶…………诶——！！？\n奶奶为什么会在这里！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3d81d55e7bd308fad0a60ee352fec43325385d405196b5339ec0b1c5f443414b", "ja": "え！　環のおばあさん……！？", "zh": "诶！环的奶奶……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1019_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "44392efe52fe1e4655cdbd5df43b179d804b9e3613d24b94ee0d9084950c1faa", "ja": "環、お疲れさま！\nばあちゃん、来ちゃったよ。", "zh": "环，辛苦啦！\n奶奶来啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1020_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "c6664d2c5e25d4580d91520a6731ccb18b0a0a3432ba51dbdf26de120726572d", "ja": "やっぱりTVと違って、本物は迫力があるねえ！\nおや、この方が{$P$}さんかい？", "zh": "果然和电视不一样，亲眼看到的就是有气势啊！\n哎呀，这位就是{$P$}先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "8a5c25562719d1c18eacf3f2ca37bb6f47115061f879086ca46d6db54b1a2825", "ja": "うん！　たまきのおやぶん！", "zh": "嗯！是环的老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1022_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "d5db9c201914a81fa4540dbcf198b566867005341f43cb93e2bac322268567a5", "ja": "いつもお世話になっております、\n大神環の祖母でございます。", "zh": "承蒙您平日关照，\n我是大神环的祖母。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1023_tamakititi", "source_sha256": "c3df9dfe0695fe118f085ff7cbe673bf38db67e6f418de39becc46c45869be79", "ja": "突然すみません……母が、どうしても\n環のステージがみたいときかなくて……。", "zh": "突然打扰了……我妈妈无论如何都想看环的舞台表演，怎么劝都不听……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c0524d515acbc9a8eedc5a927d64c49eb19de3bc194a04f79a43358eac4ba87b", "ja": "そ、そうでしたか。いえ、席は用意してあったので\n大丈夫なんですが、お怪我の具合は……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊。不，座位已经准备好了，所以没关系，不过您的伤势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "6b050eb041568a28623152b4d1e5ded5d36a9e042bf2bb1013057cfeeff1abd1", "ja": "そうだよ、ばあちゃんケガは！？\n入院してなくていいの！？", "zh": "对了，奶奶你的伤怎么样了！？\n不用住院真的没关系吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1026_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "a3f074068665936f95445c165a63de26ecc7b210f80c0afe7578bb9858cc7ed3", "ja": "大丈夫、ただの捻挫だって。\nなんともないけんね。", "zh": "没事的，只是扭伤而已。\n完全不要紧啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1027_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "78d401adecdf61522a52309329f9b6c404830f3837adb8546f6be109db559040", "ja": "それより環、えらかったねえ。ばあちゃん見てたけど、\nお客さん、みんな楽しそうにニコニコしとったよ。", "zh": "不过环，你表现得很棒呢。奶奶都看着呢，客人们全都笑眯眯的，看起来很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1028_tamakisobo", "source_sha256": "14541b2e3d04a3f98765ab9fed8695599eb08767fc0bbdfb0e9e655b2dc2c02c", "ja": "お友達もたくさんできて……\nアイドルになって、本当によかったねえ。", "zh": "交到了很多朋友……\n能成为偶像，真的太好了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "3a2e273c8bbd4ec03a4c1bfc3c3689062bf58315b90463040ca762b7d0ac5328", "ja": "ばあちゃん……うん！\nたまき、アイドルになってよかった！！", "zh": "奶奶……嗯！\n环能成为偶像，真是太好了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1030_p", "source_sha256": "12df9e15ffa853705b89bfff086157a4722467b01ed3c823dd35b10f49a3e0db", "ja": "（環の表情から、漸く、一切の憂いが消えた）", "zh": "（环的表情终于完全消除了忧愁。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_132_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7f38dc58a539fae4bfad9e1c53320d59d2d981ee9a5cff83b7a20e997260797d", "ja": "（厳しい状況にもめげず公演をやり遂げた事は、いつか\n自信に繋がるはずだ。……本当にお疲れさま、環！）", "zh": "（不因艰难的处境而气馁，坚持完成演出这件事，总有一天一定会化为她的自信吧。……真的辛苦了，环！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
